  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research on Trade deals and on key global economic governance policy areas, including investment for infrastructure, tax and transparency and migration, designed to enable SA Government to better represent African views in international Fora incl G20</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Research on Trade deals and on key global economic governance policy areas, including investment for infrastructure, tax and transparency and migration, designed to enable SA Government to better represent African views in international Fora incl G20 is a component of South African Partnership for Global Economic Governance: Phase 2 reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xA3;1,103,552. This project benefits Africa, regional. It works in the following sector(s): Public sector policy and administrative management, Trade policy and administrative management, Democratic participation and civil society.</narrative>
  </description>
